{"version":1,"content":"<p>4歲女童心悅於2024年5月因受傷而在仁濟醫院接受頭部縫針後，一度心臟驟停，其後在瑪嘉烈醫院兒科深切治療部留醫，直至去年2月不治。</p><p>女童的兩名遺產管理人上周四（15日）入稟區域法院向醫管局索償。</p><p>司法機構網頁顯示，案件排期於2027年4月12日作核對列表審核聆訊。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.255647+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T06:05:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T21:17:44.803529+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684168+00:00","content_hash":"6f9655481654a9f8fcc47cdd0869086a26d9d9b9c640f7ec707d2a671f2a9cb6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}